# AmigaOS 4 launcher list: Title|program. Programs that aren't
# installed are left out of the menu. Deploy beside DH1:launcher.
# Arguments may follow the program: FULLSCREEN gives a game a screen of
# its own (F or F10 switches back to a window while playing).
Planet Chomp|DH1:planet_chomp FULLSCREEN
Rolling Steel|DH1:rolling_steel/rolling_steel FULLSCREEN
Spectral Keep|DH1:spectral_keep/spectral_keep FULLSCREEN
Terra Strike|DH1:terra_strike/terra_strike FULLSCREEN
Void Trader|DH1:void_trader
Canyon Rescue|DH1:canyon_rescue
Emberkeep|DH1:emberkeep
Warden Keep|DH1:warden_keep
Masterwork|DH1:masterwork
Terrain Test|DH1:terrain_test
Organizer|DH1:organizer
TrapezePDF|DH1:TrapezePDF
NetSurf|DH1:NetSurf/NetSurf
